            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-80229-curl",
              "name": "DpkgMatcherExactDirectMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-80229 medium vulnerability for curl package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "When performing transfers via libcurl’s multi interface, pooled TLS\nconnections can outlive their originating easy handles. In OpenSSL 3 provider\nconfigurations, libcurl attaches an allocated library context to the easy\nhandle's state and passes it to OpenSSL without acquiring an ownership\nreference; destroying the easy handle prematurely frees this context while the\nactive connection retains a dangling pointer, leading to a heap-use-after-free\nupon subsequent I/O or post-handshake operations."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://ubuntu.com/security/CVE-2026-80229",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-80229\nSeverity: medium\nPackage: curl\nVersion: 8.5.0-2ubuntu10.13\nFix Version: \nType: deb\nLocation: /var/lib/dpkg/status\nData Namespace: ubuntu:distro:ubuntu:24.04\nLink: [CVE-2026-80229](https://ubuntu.com/security/CVE-2026-80229)",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-80229**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| medium  | curl  | 8.5.0-2ubuntu10.13  |   | deb  | /var/lib/dpkg/status  | ubuntu:distro:ubuntu:24.04  | [CVE-2026-80229](https://ubuntu.com/security/CVE-2026-80229)  |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
                "purls": [
                  "pkg:deb/ubuntu/curl@8.5.0-2ubuntu10.13?arch=amd64\u0026distro=ubuntu-24.04"
                ],
                "security-severity": "7.5"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-80255-curl",
              "name": "DpkgMatcherExactDirectMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-80255 medium vulnerability for curl package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "A `Set-Cookie:` header using tab (horizontal tab, ASCII code 9) instead of\nspace (ascii code 32) immediately before the `Secure` attribute causes curl to\nstore the cookie without its Secure flag. The cookie might then wrongfully be\nsent over plaintext HTTP on subsequent requests to the same host."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://ubuntu.com/security/CVE-2026-80255",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-80255\nSeverity: medium\nPackage: curl\nVersion: 8.5.0-2ubuntu10.13\nFix Version: \nType: deb\nLocation: /var/lib/dpkg/status\nData Namespace: ubuntu:distro:ubuntu:24.04\nLink: [CVE-2026-80255](https://ubuntu.com/security/CVE-2026-80255)",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-80255**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| medium  | curl  | 8.5.0-2ubuntu10.13  |   | deb  | /var/lib/dpkg/status  | ubuntu:distro:ubuntu:24.04  | [CVE-2026-80255](https://ubuntu.com/security/CVE-2026-80255)  |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
                "purls": [
                  "pkg:deb/ubuntu/curl@8.5.0-2ubuntu10.13?arch=amd64\u0026distro=ubuntu-24.04"
                ],
                "security-severity": "7.5"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-82209-curl",
              "name": "DpkgMatcherExactDirectMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-82209 medium vulnerability for curl package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "When libpsl support is enabled, libcurl fails to enforce the Public Suffix\nList boundary check when processing a `Set-Cookie` header where the `Domain`\nattribute explicitly matches an origin host that is itself a public suffix\n(e.g., `Domain=co.uk` set by `co.uk`).\n\nInstead of coercing it into a strict host-only cookie, libcurl saves the\ncookie with wildcard domain scope (`.co.uk`). Consequently, the cookie is\ninappropriately included in subsequent outbound requests or HTTP redirects to\narbitrary sibling subdomains under the same public suffix (e.g.,\n`attacker.co.uk`)."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://ubuntu.com/security/CVE-2026-82209",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-82209\nSeverity: medium\nPackage: curl\nVersion: 8.5.0-2ubuntu10.13\nFix Version: \nType: deb\nLocation: /var/lib/dpkg/status\nData Namespace: ubuntu:distro:ubuntu:24.04\nLink: [CVE-2026-82209](https://ubuntu.com/security/CVE-2026-82209)",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-82209**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| medium  | curl  | 8.5.0-2ubuntu10.13  |   | deb  | /var/lib/dpkg/status  | ubuntu:distro:ubuntu:24.04  | [CVE-2026-82209](https://ubuntu.com/security/CVE-2026-82209)  |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
                "purls": [
                  "pkg:deb/ubuntu/curl@8.5.0-2ubuntu10.13?arch=amd64\u0026distro=ubuntu-24.04"
                ],
                "security-severity": "8.2"
              }
            },
