              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "A flaw was found in GNU tar. When extracting an archive with the --one-top-level option, hardlink targets are not confined to the designated top-level directory and may resolve relative to the extraction working directory. A crafted archive can create hardlinks that escape the intended boundary and, when combined with a preexisting symbolic link under the working directory, may allow writing outside that boundary during a single extraction."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://ubuntu.com/security/CVE-2026-18508",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-18508\nSeverity: medium\nPackage: tar\nVersion: 1.35+dfsg-3ubuntu0.4\nFix Version: \nType: deb\nLocation: /var/lib/dpkg/status\nData Namespace: ubuntu:distro:ubuntu:24.04\nLink: [CVE-2026-18508](https://ubuntu.com/security/CVE-2026-18508)",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-18508**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| medium  | tar  | 1.35+dfsg-3ubuntu0.4  |   | deb  | /var/lib/dpkg/status  | ubuntu:distro:ubuntu:24.04  | [CVE-2026-18508](https://ubuntu.com/security/CVE-2026-18508)  |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
                "purls": [
                  "pkg:deb/ubuntu/tar@1.35%2Bdfsg-3ubuntu0.4?arch=amd64\u0026distro=ubuntu-24.04"
                ],
                "security-severity": "4.4"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-82208-curl",
              "name": "DpkgMatcherExactDirectMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-82208 medium vulnerability for curl package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "With the wolfSSL backend, when CA caching is enabled and an\n`CURLOPT_SSL_CTX_FUNCTION` callback replaces the trust store, libcurl can\nsilently reinstall the cached store after the callback returns. A certificate\ntrusted by the cached store but rejected by the callback-selected store is\nthen incorrectly accepted."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://ubuntu.com/security/CVE-2026-82208",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-82208\nSeverity: medium\nPackage: curl\nVersion: 8.5.0-2ubuntu10.13\nFix Version: \nType: deb\nLocation: /var/lib/dpkg/status\nData Namespace: ubuntu:distro:ubuntu:24.04\nLink: [CVE-2026-82208](https://ubuntu.com/security/CVE-2026-82208)",
